.TH BIGGUNS 1
.SH NAME
bigguns \- artillery game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/bigguns
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I BigGuns
is a artillery game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Aim a barrel on a scrolling height-map, fire shells under gravity, and pan the camera with comma and full stop.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Left / a
Aim barrel left
.TP
.B Right / d
Aim barrel right
.TP
.B space
Fire shell
.TP
.B ,
Pan camera left
.TP
.B .
Pan camera right
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/bigguns.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR ode (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
